<p>Your mastery of called shots is unparalleled. and you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 5%, 7%, 8%, 10%</acronym> bonus critical chance and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 12%, 15%, 17%, 20%</acronym> critical damage with your Called Shots Talents. At rank 3 the cooldowns of all of your Called Shots Talents are reduced by 2 each. At rank 5 you gain <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">15%, 24%, 35%, 43%, 49%</acronym> Physical resistance penetration with all Called Shot attacks.</p>